{"3707400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "On-Together: Virtual Co-Working", "steam_appid": 3707400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4712260, 4338890], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/9c8cb0bf1ad58eadb21171a0dd459c2d.avif?t=1783519674\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras_big/9c8cb0bf1ad58eadb21171a0dd459c2d.webp?t=1783519674 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/76ece90be56251ecc1b92339bec1aebc.poster.avif?t=1783519674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/76ece90be56251ecc1b92339bec1aebc.webm?t=1783519674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/76ece90be56251ecc1b92339bec1aebc.mp4?t=1783519674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>     <strong>Co-working just got cuter!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On-Together: Virtual Co-Working is a digital third space designed to help you focus and stay connected. Work or study with your friends and strangers from all over the world!<br>      </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-work with friends or strangers in a cozy virtual workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in fullscreen, on the side of your screen or in transparent sticker mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use productivity tools including a customisable Pomodoro timer and to-do list to stay on track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your avatars all sit together in the corner of your screen while you work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet up in a variety of locations including a library, treehouse and floating lily pads! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the focus animation for your character that matches your real life task, like reading, doing chores or painting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make your avatar your own, choosing from a huge variety of human and animal customisation options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn tickets as you focus that you can trade for new clothing, power ups, pet companions AND MORE!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take regular breaks and play minigames like basketball, fishing or music jams!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hang out! Lock in! Repeat!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.poster.avif?t=1783519674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.webm?t=1783519674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/d14c48eaf7a4b2d1e6d14e22ff159556.mp4?t=1783519674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3707400/extras/76ece90be56251ecc1b92339bec1aebc.poster.avif?t=1783519674\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.co